---
interface Props {
  total: number;
  categoryCount: number;
}
const { total, categoryCount } = Astro.props;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="grid items-center gap-8 py-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-12 lg:py-12">
  <p class="sr-only">사용 3단계: 1) 카테고리에서 도구를 고르고 2) 상세 페이지에서 원문을 복사한 뒤 3) 에이전트 설정이나 채팅창에 붙여넣습니다. Three steps: browse, copy, paste.</p>
  <div>
    <p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent-500/30 bg-accent-500/10 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[0.7rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-300">
      <span class="caret !h-[0.8em] !w-[0.4em]"></span>
      Toolbox for AI coding agents
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-balance text-[clamp(2rem,1.2rem+3.4vw,3.25rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">
      검증된 에이전트 도구를<br />
      <span class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">복사 한 번</span>으로 바로.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-pretty text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">
      A curated, copy-paste toolbox of prompts, skills, hooks and configs for Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI and more.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-pretty leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
      AI 코딩 에이전트에 바로 붙여 넣는 프롬프트·스킬·훅·설정을 한곳에 모았습니다.
      설치 없이 둘러보고, 마음에 드는 항목의 <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-800 dark:text-ink-100">원문을 복사</strong>해 그대로 쓰세요.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a href="#catalog" class="btn btn-primary px-5 py-2.5 text-sm">
        카탈로그 둘러보기
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-ghost px-5 py-2.5 text-sm">
        어떻게 쓰나요?
        <span class="font-mono text-[0.72rem] text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">How it works</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
        <dt class="font-mono text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">{total}</dt>
        <dd class="text-ink-500">개 항목 · items</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
        <dt class="font-mono text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">{categoryCount}</dt>
        <dd class="text-ink-500">개 카테고리 · categories</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
        <dt class="font-mono text-xl font-semibold text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400">OSS</dt>
        <dd class="text-ink-500">대부분 오픈소스 · mostly OSS</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>

  <!-- Terminal demo: the browse → copy → paste flow (brand memory moment) -->
  <div class="pc-term" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="pc-term-bar">
      <span class="pc-term-dot bg-[#ff5f57]"></span>
      <span class="pc-term-dot bg-[#febc2e]"></span>
      <span class="pc-term-dot bg-[#28c840]"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-ink-400">promptbox · 3 steps</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-2.5 p-4">
      <p class="text-ink-400"># 1 · 카테고리에서 도구를 고르고</p>
      <p class="break-all"><span class="text-accent-400">$</span> open promptbox/skills/<span class="text-ink-50">diagnose</span></p>
      <p class="text-ink-400"># 2 · 상세 페이지에서 원문을 복사한 뒤</p>
      <p class="break-all"><span class="text-accent-400">$</span> pbpaste &gt; ~/.claude/skills/diagnose/<span class="text-ink-50">SKILL.md</span></p>
      <p class="text-ink-400"># 3 · 에이전트에서 바로 호출</p>
      <p><span class="text-accent-400">&gt;</span> /diagnose <span class="caret"></span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
